h d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg> <!-- -->Multi-Model Ensemble</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/25 text-cyan-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap w-3 h-3\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg> <!-- -->17 Disease Classes</span><span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/25 text-cyan-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scan-line w-3 h-3\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2\"></path><path d=\"M7 12h10\"></path></svg> <!-- -->Grad-CAM Heatmap</span></div></div><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-500/8 border border-amber-500/25\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-triangle-alert w-5 h-5 text-amber-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-sm text-amber-200/80\"><span class=\"font-semibold text-amber-300\">Screening Tool Only.</span> <!-- -->This AI analyzes chest X-rays for 17 conditions but is NOT a medical diagnosis. Results require correlation with clinical findings. Always consult a qualified radiologist or physician for interpretation.</p></div><div class=\"\n        relative border-2 border-dashed rounded-3xl p-14 text-center cursor-pointer\n        transition-all duration-300 group\n        border-white/15 bg-white/[0.02] hover:border-cyan-400/60 hover:bg-cyan-500/5\n        \n      \"><input type=\"file\" class=\"hidden\" accept=\"image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-cyan-400/40 to-transparent animate-[scan_3s_ease-in-out_infinite]\"></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-col items-center gap-5\"><div class=\"relative w-24 h-24 rounded-2xl bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-500/25 flex items-center justify-center group-hover:border-cyan-400/50 transition-all duration-300\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-scan-line w-10 h-10 text-cyan-400\"><path d=\"M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2\"></path><path d=\"M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2\"></path><path d=\"M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2\"></path><path d=\"M7 12h10\"></path></svg><div class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-cyan-500 flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-[8px] text-white font-bold\">AI</span></div></div><div><p class=\"text-white font-semibold text-lg\">Drop chest X-ray here</p><p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm mt-1\">or<!-- --> <span class=\"text-cyan-400 font-medium underline underline-offset-2\">browse files</span></p></div><p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500\">JPEG · PNG · WEBP  ·  Max <!-- -->10<!-- --> MB</p></div></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info w-3.5 h-3.5\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg> X-Ray Upload Tips</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3\"><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/8 space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-xl\">🩻</p><p class=\"text-white text-xs font-semibold\">PA View</p><p class=\"text-slate-500 text-xs\">Posteroanterior view is ideal</p></div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/8 space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-xl\">💡</p><p class=\"text-white text-xs font-semibold\">Good Exposure</p><p class=\"text-slate-500 text-xs\">Avoid overexposed or too dark films</p></div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/8 space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-xl\">📐</p><p class=\"text-white text-xs font-semibold\">Full Chest</p><p class=\"text-slate-500 text-xs\">Include both lung fields completely</p></div><div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/8 space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-xl\">🔍</p><p class=\"text-white text-xs font-semibold\">High Res</p><p class=\"text-slate-500 text-xs\">Min 512×512 px for best accuracy</p></div></div></div><div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/10 space-y-3\"><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500 uppercase tracking-wider\">17 Conditions Screened</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-x-4 gap-y-2 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-red-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Pneumonia</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">High<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-red-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Tuberculosis</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">High<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-red-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Cardiomegaly</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">High<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-red-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Pneumothorax</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">High<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-red-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Edema</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">High<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-red-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Mass</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">High<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-amber-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Effusion</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Moderate<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-amber-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Atelectasis</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Moderate<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-amber-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Emphysema</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Moderate<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-amber-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Fibrosis</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Moderate<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-amber-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Nodule</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Moderate<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-amber-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Consolidation</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Moderate<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-amber-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Pleural Thickening</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Moderate<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-amber-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Infiltration</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Moderate<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-emerald-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Scoliosis</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Low<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-emerald-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">Hernia</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Low<!-- --> risk</p></div></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full flex-shrink-0 bg-emerald-500\"></div><div><p class=\"text-slate-300 font-medium\">No Finding</p><p class=\"text-slate-600\">Low<!-- --> risk</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></main><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Notifications (F8)\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"pointer-events:none\"><ol tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"fixed top-4 right-4 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse gap-2 p-4 sm:max-w-[390px]\"></ol></div><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/webpack-aa44a63be2da1f40.js\" async=\"\"></script><scri